{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_1000_place", "source_sha256": "2eac3a40fc07710d441025c7f019e77f8c451a36bc6677b154f3b53ed164681e", "ja": "イベント会場", "zh": "活动会场", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_1001_009rit", "source_sha256": "95cbad83d70396f03f9823d879032027cd5bbea9802505ee35e71316482cbb4c", "ja": "ちょっと{$P$}、\nまだ握手会の最中なのに、どうしたんですか？", "zh": "欸，{$P$}，\n目前还正在举办握手会，怎么突然叫住我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_1002_p", "source_sha256": "34025bd50c6e7560dc5ef5d98f4525505955adc2f32949964d5e995607557bb1", "ja": "律子、じっくり一人一人と握手するのもいいんだけど、\nもう時間がないんだ。ペースを上げないと……。", "zh": "律子，你想仔细地和每一个人握手是很好，\n但是已经没时间了，得加快速度……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "ced205acb082807da6efd758e2e550cb09b2136174ca32766476c846eef111c0", "ja": "なーんだ。そのことなら想定済みです♪\n状況を冷静に見極めた上でのスピードですから。", "zh": "什么啊，若是这件事，我已经设想过了♪\n这是我冷静观察状况后决定的速度。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "08d0eb64bfcb7f3bf0e01ef43b5cf29fd2afee3fe00e2dadac3c9f2a14eac64c", "ja": "ほら、よく見てください。列の後ろに並んでるように\n見える人たち、あれは野次馬ですから♪", "zh": "来，你仔细看好了。那些看起来\n像是在后面排队的人，其实是来看热闹的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_1005_009rit", "source_sha256": "b1f237e5632d7d7523a9b5ab6adc7e1d0fd16d6b342d8f8e8e1c23a27a81973c", "ja": "ずっと並んでくれてる人達には、\n今のペースでバッチリ、間に合います！", "zh": "要消化掉一直在排队的那些人，\n现在的速度就最完美了，一定来得及！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_1006_p", "source_sha256": "19c12365640937380b77c8c77b609a14cea42a6ca87c815cf0cb0b128302c732", "ja": "おお、なるほど！　そこまで見極めていたとは……\nあれ？　今、列がぐっと長くなったような？", "zh": "哦哦，原来如此！没想到你会观察得这么透彻……\n咦？刚才队伍好像突然变长了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_1007_009rit", "source_sha256": "57b1d15038c8cc95b281c13fd8915045d4173587c930c3ebf752001fb6837555", "ja": "え？　まさか横入り……あ、グループの代表者だけが\n並んでたのね！？　あ、また……もう～！", "zh": "咦？该不会是插队……啊，是只有派团体的代表\n来排队吧！？啊，又来了……真是的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
